VE-2013-0044.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2013-0088","file_name":"2013/AVE-2013-0088.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2013-0632","title":"Adobe ColdFusion 身份验证绕过漏洞","description":"Adobe ColdFusion 9.0、9.0.1、9.0.2 及 10 版本中的 administrator.cfc 组件存在身份验证绕过漏洞。远程攻击者可利用 RDS 组件的默认空密码直接登录，进而访问管理后台 Web 界面，无需任何身份凭证即可获取系统完全控制权限，实现任意代码执行。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重，已在 2013 年 1 月被野外大规模利用。Adobe 官方已发布安全更新修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2013-0632"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2013-01-17T00:55:01Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:49:48Z","remediation":"立即升级 Adobe ColdFusion 至 9.0.2 CHF1 或 10 Update 1 及以上版本（参考 APSB13-03）。如无法升级，在 CFAdmin 中禁用 RDS 服务（取消勾选\"Enable RDS\"），或为 RDS 设置强密码（CFAdmin > RDS > Password）。同时在网络层面限制对 ColdFusion 管理后台（/CFIDE/administrator/）的访问来源 IP。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.adobe.com/support/security/advisories/apsa13-01.html","http://www.adobe.com/support/security/bulletins/apsb13-03.html","http://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/30210","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2013-0632","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/27755","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2013/CVE-2013-0632.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6e1fee15e021f95477107e3e5d652470f76f7bac/cves/2013/0xxx/CVE-2013-0632.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2013/CVE-2013-0632","https://github.com/fnmsd/awvs_script_decode/blob/ce24b3ea8777c948052eea831b614324fd4b638f/Scripts/XML/ColdFusion_CVE-2013-0632.xml","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/ffa50060b7ba6ae58d60d6d90533e77eaf10d466/2013/CVE-2013-0632/README.md","https://github.com/e-m-b-a/emba/blob/4d0f24b3edae0bdb5391177851bad3be54ecea0f/config/msf_cve-db.txt","https://github.com/vulncheck-oss/0day.today.archive/blob/3664abdd71985a44aff3260896a8f36e2f4a9682/web-applications/21141.txt","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-ai-security-hub/blob/13403e1745f63237e7ef6d51562fb36112320d77/frontend/cve/CVE-2013-0632.html","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2013-0632.txt","https://github.com/hershate/Database/blob/6c627022c810bef27069052468abe9305e9d9222/CVE-Reports/2013/CVE-2013-0632/report.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2013/AVE-2013-0088.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2013-0033","file_name":"2013/AVE-2013-0033.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2013-0422","title":"Oracle Java 7 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Oracle Java 7 Update 11 之前版本存在两处远程代码执行漏洞。其一，攻击者可通过 JmxMBeanServer 类的 getMBeanInstantiator 方法获取私有 MBeanInstantiator 对象引用，进而利用 findClass 方法加载任意类；其二，利用 Reflection API 递归调用绕过 java.lang.invoke.MethodHandles.Lookup.checkSecurityManager 的安全检查。远程攻击者可通过诱导用户访问恶意网页触发漏洞，在无需认证的情况下完全控制目标系统。该漏洞已在 2013 年 1 月被 Blackhole 和 Nuclear Pack 漏洞利用工具包大规模利用于野外攻击。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2013-0422"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2013-01-10T21:55:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:49:24Z","remediation":"立即升级 Oracle Java 7 至 Update 11 或更高版本（Java 7u11 已修复 JmxMBeanServer 反射绕过漏洞）。如无法升级，在浏览器中禁用 Java Applet 插件（控制面板 → Java → 安全 → 取消勾选\"在浏览器中启用 Java 内容\"），并将安全级别设为\"高\"。对于服务器环境，移除不必要的 JMX MBean 组件暴露。Java 6 不受此漏洞影响，可降级至 Java 6 作为临时方案。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://blog.fireeye.com/research/2013/01/happy-new-year-from-new-java-zero-day.html","http://blog.fuseyism.com/index.php/2013/01/15/security-icedtea-2-1-4-2-2-4-2-3-4-released/","http://immunityproducts.blogspot.ca/2013/01/confirmed-java-only-fixed-one-of-two.html","http://krebsonsecurity.com/2013/01/zero-day-java-exploit-debuts-in-crimeware/","http://labs.alienvault.com/labs/index.php/2013/new-year-new-java-zeroday/","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2013-01/msg00025.html","http://malware.dontneedcoffee.com/2013/01/0-day-17u10-spotted-in-while-disable.html","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2013-0156.html","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2013-0165.html","http://seclists.org/bugtraq/2013/Jan/48","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/625617","http://www.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDVSA-2013:095","http://www.oracle.com/technetwork/topics/security/alert-cve-2013-0422-1896849.html","http://www.ubuntu.com/usn/USN-1693-1","http://www.us-cert.gov/cas/techalerts/TA13-010A.html","https://partners.immunityinc.com/idocs/Java%20MBeanInstantiator.findClass%200day%20Analysis.pdf","https://threatpost.com/en_us/blogs/nasty-new-java-zero-day-found-exploit-kits-already-have-it-011013","https://wiki.mageia.org/en/Support/Advisories/MGASA-2013-0018","https://www-304.ibm.com/connections/blogs/PSIRT/entry/oracle_java_7_security_manager_bypass_vulnerability_cve_2013_04224?lang=en_us","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2013-0422","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/24045","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2013/CVE-2013-0422.md","https://github.com/Yara-Rules/rules/blob/0f93570194a80d2f2032869055808b0ddcdfb360/cve_rules/CVE-2013-0422.yar","https://github.com/mthcht/awesome-lists/blob/7362f793762edec1cfb106598ce1c7c97d322976/Lists/Others/Defender_yara_rules/Java/Exploit/CVE-2013-0422.yara","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/5c5bad6944a5db25ea7ec6daf0fae559d8266622/2013/0xxx/CVE-2013-0422.json","https://github.com/roadwy/DefenderYara/blob/59e39903d9e6667c7c3e55a1f2887f1faab0e423/Exploit/WinNT/CVE-2013-0422/Exploit_WinNT_CVE-2013-0422.yar","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/retired/CVE-2013-0422","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/ffa50060b7ba6ae58d60d6d90533e77eaf10d466/2013/CVE-2013-0422/README_KO.md","https://github.com/RandomRhythm/YARA_Rules_Project_Sorted_Ruleset/blob/81d9e1fd3a194e95ff8b043784441b4e6e914ab1/cve_rules/jar/CVE-2013-0422_jar.yar","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2013-0422.txt","https://github.com/OpenWireSec/metasploit/blob/199956be7cdc22aa7a4ed00ed07283af54afc370/modules/exploits/multi/browser/java_jre17_jmxbean.rb"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2013/POC-AVE-2013-0033.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2013/EXP-AVE-2013-0033.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2013/AVE-2013-0033.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2013-0077","file_name":"2013/AVE-2013-0077.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2013-0631","title":"Adobe ColdFusion 敏感信息泄露漏洞","description":"Adobe ColdFusion 9.0、9.0.1 及 9.0.2 版本存在敏感信息泄露漏洞，攻击者可通过未指定的向量远程获取服务器敏感信息。该漏洞无需身份认证即可利用，攻击复杂度低，且已在 2013 年 1 月被野外利用。成功利用可导致配置文件、数据库凭证等敏感数据泄露，进一步扩大攻击面。该漏洞已被纳入 CISA 已知被利用漏洞目录（KEV），建议立即修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2013-0631"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2013-01-09T01:55:03Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:49:47Z","remediation":"立即升级 Adobe ColdFusion 至 9.0.2 并安装 APSB13-03 安全公告中提供的累积热修复（Cumulative Hotfix），或升级至 ColdFusion 10 及以上版本。如无法立即升级，在 Web 服务器（IIS/Apache）层面配置访问控制策略，限制对 CFIDE/ 及 CFIDE/administrator 目录的访问仅允许受信管理 IP，并禁用未使用的 ColdFusion Web 服务组件以缩小攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.adobe.com/support/security/advisories/apsa13-01.html","http://www.adobe.com/support/security/bulletins/apsb13-03.html","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2013-0631","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2013/CVE-2013-0631.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/5c5bad6944a5db25ea7ec6daf0fae559d8266622/2013/0xxx/CVE-2013-0631.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2013/CVE-2013-0631","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2013-0631.txt","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-ai-security-hub/blob/13403e1745f63237e7ef6d51562fb36112320d77/frontend/cve/CVE-2013-0631.html","https://github.com/Ostorlab/KEV/blob/8feadeb8b7ff54359eab87941769781629146b23/README.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2013-0631.json","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/c6c9e305761264e104c5de70e59376c519bbfef3/2013/CVE-2013-0631.md","https://github.com/lucacapacci/cisa_kev/blob/d206e936b7c9c49da608b2e68f805e3421c7432a/data_single/2013/CVE-2013-0631.csv","https://github.com/fnmsd/awvs_script_decode/blob/ce24b3ea8777c948052eea831b614324fd4b638f/Scripts/XML/ColdFusion_CVE-2013-0632.xml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2013/AVE-2013-0077.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2013-0066","file_name":"2013/AVE-2013-0066.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2013-0629","title":"Adobe ColdFusion 受限目录访问漏洞","description":"Adobe ColdFusion 9.0、9.0.1、9.0.2 及 10 版本在未配置管理员密码时存在受限目录访问漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过未公开的向量绕过目录访问限制，读取服务器上的敏感文件，导致信息泄露。该漏洞已在 2013 年 1 月被野外利用，影响范围广泛。建议用户立即配置管理员密码或升级至修复版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2013-0629"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2013-01-09T01:55:03Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:49:47Z","remediation":"立即升级 Adobe ColdFusion 至官方修复版本：CF9 升级至 9.0.2 并安装 APSB13-03 安全更新，CF10 升级至 Update 2 或更高版本。同时务必在 ColdFusion Administrator 中设置管理员密码，禁止空密码部署。如无法立即升级，可在 Web 服务器（IIS/Apache）层面配置访问控制规则，限制对 /CFIDE/ 等敏感目录的远程访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.adobe.com/support/security/advisories/apsa13-01.html","http://www.adobe.com/support/security/bulletins/apsb13-03.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/57165","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2013-0629"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2013/POC-AVE-2013-0066.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2013/EXP-AVE-2013-0066.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2013/AVE-2013-0066.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2013-0055","file_name":"2013/AVE-2013-0055.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2013-0625","title":"Adobe ColdFusion 验证绕过漏洞","description":"Adobe ColdFusion 9.0、9.0.1 及 9.0.2 版本在未配置管理员密码时存在认证绕过漏洞。远程攻击者无需任何身份凭证即可绕过系统认证机制，通过未指定的向量直接访问管理控制台，进而可能执行任意代码。该漏洞在 2013 年 1 月已被野外利用，影响范围广泛，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。建议用户立即配置管理员密码或升级至修复版本。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2013-0625"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2013-01-09T01:55:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:49:47Z","remediation":"立即升级 Adobe ColdFusion 至 9.0.2 Update 1 或更高版本（Adobe 已针对此漏洞发布 APSB13-03 安全公告）。同时务必为 ColdFusion 管理控制台设置强密码，禁止将管理员接口暴露在公网，并在防火墙或反向代理层面限制对 /CFIDE/ 和 /CFIDE/administrator/ 路径的访问。如无法立即升级，可临时禁用未使用的 RDS 服务并移除默认的 admin 用户。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.adobe.com/support/security/advisories/apsa13-01.html","http://www.adobe.com/support/security/bulletins/apsb13-03.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/57164","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2013-0625","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2013/CVE-2013-0625.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/27eee309d10a00ce5571c5ab1765599e23f1725f/cves/2013/0xxx/CVE-2013-0625.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2013/CVE-2013-0625","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/5c5bad6944a5db25ea7ec6daf0fae559d8266622/2013/0xxx/CVE-2013-0625.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/ffa50060b7ba6ae58d60d6d90533e77eaf10d466/2013/CVE-2013-0625/README.md","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2013-0625.txt","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-ai-security-hub/blob/13403e1745f63237e7ef6d51562fb36112320d77/frontend/cve/CVE-2013-0625.html","https://github.com/vulncheck-oss/0day.today.archive/blob/3664abdd71985a44aff3260896a8f36e2f4a9682/remote-exploits/20637.txt","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2013/CVE-2013-0625.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d8c03b84658bbca948e09e4af723cb11141fb41e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-mhww-rmfc-8prf/GHSA-mhww-rmfc-8prf.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2013/AVE-2013-0055.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2013-0001","file_name":"2013/AVE-2013-0001.toml","cve_id":"无","title":"NeZha 哪吒面板路径穿越漏洞","description":"哪吒面板存在路径穿越漏洞，攻击者可通过构造特殊的路径请求读取服务器上的 JWT 密钥文件，进而伪造合法令牌实现未授权接管面板管理权限。该漏洞影响哪吒面板 v2.0.13 之前的所有版本，攻击者只需网络可达目标面板即可远程利用，无需任何认证。建议立即升级至 v2.0.13 及以上版本修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["HWPOC-2026-054c988e"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2013-01-01T00:00:00Z","updated":"2013-01-01T00:00:00Z","remediation":"立即升级至哪吒面板 v2.0.13 或以上版本，该版本修复了路径穿越漏洞。升级后需重新生成 JWT 密钥并重启面板服务，确保旧的已泄露密钥失效。如无法立即升级，可在反向代理层添加路径规范化规则，阻止包含 ../ 等目录穿越特征的请求访问面板管理接口。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":[],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2013/AVE-2013-0001.toml"}]